  "body": "### Summary\r\n\r\nThis PR is a collection of minor cleanups.\r\nIt also closes #64\r\n\r\n\r\n### Details and comments\r\n\r\nGrepping for `num_orbitals` still returns results in modules/classes which will be removed before the release. I did not bother changing things there, too. These include:\r\n- `qiskit_nature.transformations`\r\n- `qiskit_nature.components`\r\n\r\n`qiskit_nature.algorithms` will be tackled during #83.\r\n\r\n",
